Why this licence: parts of neoless (how the polishing prompt treats the user's hot
words, the live transcript rail, how the clipboard is restored after a paste) were
modelled on OpenLess (https://github.com/Open-Less/openless), which is licensed
AGPL-3.0-only. The text and code here were written for neoless, but they follow that
project closely enough that the same licence is the honest choice. See CREDITS.md.

Two things this licence cannot settle, both described in CREDITS.md: the outline of
the polishing prompt still follows a third-party style pack whose licence is unclear
(its sentences were all rewritten), and the look of the recording capsule follows
Typeless (a commercial product) and OpenLess in spirit; its code is neoless's own.

neoless is an unofficial personal project. It is not affiliated with Typeless,
OpenLess, Cloudflare, Alibaba, Apple or the provider of any AI model it can sign in
to. Their names are used only to say what neoless works with or was modelled on.
Using a provider's account is subject to that provider's terms. The sign-in follows
the flow of the provider's open-source command-line client; none of its code is here.

